48 columns:

  Edit Shortcut
  Open Transcript · Global
  Current ctrl-t · Default keymap
  Config `tui.keymap.global.open_transcript`
  Open the transcript overlay.

› 1. Replace binding
     Capture one key and replace `ctrl-t`.
  2. Add alternate binding
     Keep the current binding and add another
     key.
  –  Remove custom binding (disabled)
     No custom root override to remove.
  3. Back to shortcuts
     Return to the shortcut list.

  Changes write the root `tui.keymap.*`
  override.
  enter select · esc back

